Package: bendr
Type: Package
Title: Fits dose-response curves
Version: 0.4.1
Author: Alexander Betz, Anze Zupanic, Christoph Schür <christoph.schuer@eawag.ch> (contributor)
Maintainer: Alexander Betz <alexander.betz@gmail.com>
Description: Fit one or more dose response curves.
    The default model is a sigmoid dose response curve normalised to a 100% effect level
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/schuerc/bendr
BugReports: https://github.com/schuerc/bendr/issues
